{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-17_beg","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"main_16-16","title":"力竭聲嘶","storyCode":"16-17","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-17_beg.txt","sourceHash":"82272b624cf468f92d08ef97a90e4c0a43ebd8c17bc1c04679dd550948b5201b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"Mantra選擇隔絕聖愚的影響，在別喬克的幫助下成功喚醒了礦工。Raidian攔截了集團軍想要掩蓋真相和不斷屠殺遠北各個礦區的礦工的消息。隨後，Mantra發出全域廣播，公開真相。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i10_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"使用源石技藝戰鬥並不是整場交鋒中最困難的部分。\n紅與黑的迷霧瀰漫，白色的身影置於其中，不言語，也沒有動作，甚至連衣袂都不曾移動分毫。\n它不閃躲、不反擊，任由周身環繞的屏障凋零，只是沉默地存在著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i21"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個空洞的、吞噬一切的漩渦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你到底……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert03_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"意識空間的場景仍然在不斷變換，他們再度回到起點。\n一處無法分辨位置和名字的荒野，又或者可以將其簡單地稱為——\n薩爾貢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乞求的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼……這一切究竟是為什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乞求的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有天災破壞我們的家園還不夠，為什麼還有戰爭奪取我們的性命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乞求的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"帕夏，沉默而智慧的帕夏……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乞求的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請聆聽我的困惑，並寬慰……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乞求的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的痛苦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……徒勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你在我的意識中怎樣翻找，都無法製造出使我選擇在虛無中安眠的幻景。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"■■，■……■■。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你■■……帕夏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra？","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一位帕夏，這就是你的過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra？","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的子民懇求你的寬慰，你卻不肯施捨一場幻景給他們，哪怕只是舉手之勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那並非慰藉，只是謊言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"古老而腐朽的王權不會因一場美夢而動搖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我離開了那裡，那是一場自發的逃離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra？","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的確沒有絲毫動搖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra？","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的聲音……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖愚，你無法變成聲音的源頭。你無法變成……“我”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我無法言語，也因為你只是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“回聲”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“世人看到的我的模樣，只反映了他們對我的認知和期待。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你因此存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我對你，對我自身的愚妄……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毫無期待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很強大……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你未經考驗與洗禮，卻擁有幾乎與我無異的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你卻輕視這份力量，這份天生的恩賜……你本該用它來宣揚真理，你本該用它來引領你的子民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是什麼讓你離開了自己的宮殿？是什麼讓你放棄了力量，使你軟弱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只因我意識到……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知識比王權恆久，真理比謊言強大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你用一場謊言鼓動人們奔向滅亡的道路，讓所有人葬身於這片凍原。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"究竟為何？"},{"type":"narration","text":"一陣輕柔的笑聲在空間中傳開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啟示，是■■，是佈道，是獻祭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大地即將迎來劇變，不強大的，悉數毀滅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"於是，我養育一顆火種，使它壯大、蔓延。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"使它焚盡所有不潔的德行，使一切在其中重生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mantra篤定自己能夠殺死它，在這裡，在意識中，掐滅它不會比掐滅一束燭光困難多少。\n然而只是殺死它，對現狀究竟有何種幫助？她不確定。更不用說，如果你的敵人甚至不曾入戰，又遑論勝利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別再浪費時間了，聖愚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"立刻停止你對這裡所有人的影響，讓他們跟隨我離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否則，烏薩斯很快就會需要下一位聖愚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……不……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的過往厚重漫長，■■。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但一定存在，一定存在某處……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的痛苦，你避之不■■痛苦……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownN"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert03_n"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i16_1"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i01"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_i15"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"“接受它。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mantra還來不及作出任何反應。只是一瞬間的動搖，自己盡力維持的意識空間就產生了裂縫。\n意識到自己失誤的一瞬間，無數回應已經在意識空間外接連響起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我……我接受……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我接受。我早就接受了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可以吃麥稈，吃苔蘚，喝混著石頭的雪水，直到這些東西撐破我的肚皮，我就再也不會感覺到餓了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你看，死並不比活著可怕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"視線的盡頭，聖愚仍然蒼白纖長，不是顫抖著的虛影，也不是佝僂的老嫗。\n無論表象如何，只要仍有一人信服，它的存在就能被確立。\n根本原因不在那裡，而在於其他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"■■■，■■……■■。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"narration","text":"時間重新開始流動。Mantra環視四周，儘快撤離還是矯正失誤，她的理性和感性在腦中激烈交戰。\n很快，她下定了決心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"極境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要你藉助熱像儀在外面標記位置，立刻幫助我連結這裡的所有礦工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能做到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當然——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題！"},{"type":"narration","text":"女人冷冽的聲音很快出現在礦工們的腦海之中。\n幾乎在連結瞬間，她立刻意識到，這些人已經不能再承受更多精神類源石技藝的衝擊。\n聖愚能被隔絕的時間同樣有限，若想喚醒他們就必須速戰速決。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……也許接下來我要做的事，對你們來說十分殘忍，但我認為有必要公布真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果這場逃亡始於無奈與操縱，那至少，結局應該被掌握在你們自己手中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰在……說話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼我會回到這裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們不在這裡！我們已經走了，跟雷爾金一起——我們摘掉了晶片，逃出來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這不是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說對了一半。這並非現在的場景，而是過去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們殺死了那個倒在地上的人。是，還是否？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是，是！我們殺了他……雷爾金殺了他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我以為雷爾金是個英雄，他說要帶我們去一個感染者不會被歧視的地方，最終卻還是拋棄了我們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以你確認了這個場面的真實性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就在那裡！這就是我當時看到的。我們殺了人，玷汙了自己的靈魂……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再看看吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，這是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"娜迦，別喬克的奶奶。礦場裡幾乎所有人都尊敬她，連好多衛兵都不例外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你也尊敬她。像尊敬一位長輩，還是尊敬一座神像？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"能在礦場裡活到她這樣的年紀，這兩者之間已經沒有什麼差別了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她在你們當中，她也參與了這場反擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，她不在。當時她不在啊……沒有人會要求一位老人上戰場的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她在這裡，看著誰？她在為倒下的人默哀？她為什麼要為一個劊子手默哀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因為是她殺死了他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金，或者說你們，沒有殺死那個最終倒下的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"殺死他的，是他的傲慢，以及那個營造假象使你們將他的死歸罪於你們自己的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“聖愚”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"narration","text":"別喬克站在門邊。她想離開，雙腳卻無法動彈；想直視，卻沒有勇氣。\n於是她只能低頭望著手中的“秒錶”，看指針喀噠喀噠地走著，指向不同的數字。\n她想，現在是什麼時候了？哪個是時針，哪個是分針？多出來的這一個，又是什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"媽媽說，不能在雪地裡睡著。失溫會使人昏迷，太重的雪也能殺人。\n雷爾金說，不能在礦井裡恍神。缺氧會使人暈厥，看不見的氣體會點燃一切。\n但這裡不是雪地，也不是礦井，難道就代表我們可以在這裡安眠，在這裡休息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……誰能……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救我們？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"奶奶不在了，站在那裡的不是娜迦奶奶。\n不，不是……\n所以也不是在這裡。休息，但不是在搶來的、他人的家園裡；安眠，但不是因為已經喪失了活下去的力氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能睡著，不能休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們自己……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她立穩那面匆忙鍛造的“盾”，曾用來提醒在礦井中的同伴及時離開的銅鐘也掛在上面。\n別喬克揮起礦鎬，再度將它敲響。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……所以，她真的是聖愚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽見你們把她當作聖愚崇敬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是聖愚……她救了我們！難怪——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她安撫我們，分擔我們的痛苦……始終和我們在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候，你們這些人又在哪裡呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那她現在也應該繼續拯救你們。"},{"type":"narration","text":"礦工望向聖愚。它佇立，彷彿一座沉默的雕像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許是因為我們已經罪孽深重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"編造了欺騙和痛苦的加害者，要受害者忍耐並屈服，長久以來都是如此。除了順從，你們看不到別的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們沒有錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是，我們還能得救？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真該死。已經無所謂了好嗎？閉嘴啦，瓦夏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能得救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要離開這裡，繼續前進。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在活著也許比死去更可怕的情況下，選擇活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，滾吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為你能說點別的什麼。如果只是這樣，我寧願死得有個全屍，相信大家也都——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鐘聲？誰在敲鐘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是別喬克……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來，有人已經做出了選擇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"narration","text":"別喬克沉默地敲響銅鐘，即使它的聲音已與往日不同。\n她一次又一次地敲響，直到有人站起身來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收工了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收工了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想回家……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"越來越多的人從地上、從牆邊站起。層疊的人影逐漸淹沒了位於房屋盡頭的那抹蒼白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"■■■……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"聖愚的身影顫動著，穿過了Mantra，也穿過了屋內正站起身來的人們。\n它來到別喬克身前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"■■……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖愚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"別喬克低下頭，並未回答那聲呼喚。\n她只是不斷地敲著銅鐘，直到所有人都被鐘聲驚動，臉上綻開恍惚的笑容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“小枝條”，辛苦你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“小枝條”，快點回去吧，別在這裡待太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“小枝條”——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的，我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“小枝條”？"},{"type":"narration","text":"別喬克望向前方，看著同伴們嘴角的弧度回落，也看著蒼白到近乎透明的聖愚。\n她說，不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們離開，我們，活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到……“活著”，不再是我們，唯一能關注的，東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g15_ursusvillage_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家……看起來好多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra女士！您還好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是Mantra。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"溝通結束，人們已經脫離聖愚的控制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位聖愚，您打敗了它……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不會這樣說。他們自己也在努力，但那之後聖愚只是消失了，我失去了對它位置的掌控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過，目前我們有更重要的事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"集團軍……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們已經到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g8_farnorthtundra_aurora"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"極境先生，請彙報情況。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在我們行進方向上五公里內未偵測到敵人的蹤跡，可以繼續前進。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走出這片苔原後，前面的路會比較好走一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是個好消息，謝謝你，極境先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，也不能完全算是好消息，如果敵人不在前方的話，那就很有可能是在我們的後方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，你們負責殿後的隊伍一定要小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炮聲越來越近了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊伍行進的速度已經到極限了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更糟糕的是，我們完全不知道他們到底在哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，我們必須掌握更多消息，至少要想辦法掌握他們的行軍路線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想攔截軍用通訊？有辦法做到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我瞭解烏薩斯軍方通訊的加密方式，但時間已經過去很久了，我恐怕無法第一時間找到他們使用的頻段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，又要我當出賣秘密的壞人是嗎？雖然我不能保證一定有用……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果你我最後都能活著上烏薩斯的軍事法庭，我會證明你接下來的行動完全出於自保的必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個玩笑沒有你想的那麼好笑哦，“中士”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼說呢，我說的確實也不算是玩笑，所以就把要求放低一點吧，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的要求已經很低了，告訴我頻段，然後……“保持安靜”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我寫給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了，是這個頻段，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關鍵訊號追蹤……切換活躍訊號……艦載通訊設備？好吧，讓我看看……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“……感染者礦工叛亂，目前正於遠北地區流竄……”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“感染者在多地製造屠殺慘案，平民死傷慘重，且有大量感染者攜帶武裝，正朝聖駿堡方向聚集。”\n“第四集團軍迅速展開行動，出兵鎮壓，只為踐行拱衛聖駿堡、保護人民的誓言。”\n“鎮壓行動將很快結束，請民眾不要驚慌，不要反抗。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？還是被他們的厚顏無恥震驚到說不出話了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不在意料之外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣聽起來他們至少會繞開移動城市，但以防萬一還是監聽一下民用廣播……誰有地圖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不在我身上，我去拿——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這裡……有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們在聽的，消息，我能……聽一下嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道，其他礦區的，情況……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是，只有我們，離開了？還是說，也有其他人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廣播裡面說的並不是真的，別喬克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知、知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就當作是，確認……他們的安全。姐姐，可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的確沒意識到礦區廣播也是可靠的消息來源之一。謝謝你，別喬克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戈爾奇科娃中尉，麻煩你在地圖上標記一下所有位於集團軍前進方向上的移動城市。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等……電訊號自動跳躍……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍用頻段。剛才是他們向民用頻段發送的循環廣播，現在他們開始向其他隊伍共享內部通訊了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“中心礦區已清洗完畢。”\n“收到。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“清洗”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這些人，在清洗……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別喬克，不要聽！"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩搖頭，制止了Raidian想要摀住自己耳朵的動作。\n在短暫沉默之後，最新的訊息依舊被自動接收。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“衛星城礦區已清洗完畢。”\n“收到。”\n“奧洛涅茨礦區已清洗完畢。”\n“收到。”\n“沃爾格勒礦區已清洗完畢。”\n“收到。”\n……\n一個又一個熟悉或陌生的名字，混著通訊的雜訊從終端裡傳出。沒有人敢去想像通訊另一端的情形。\n一個名字，只是一個名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了，關掉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會有更多消息了……關掉它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……不要……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，要知道……我想，知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們……都是我們的……同伴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“烏拉爾礦區已清洗完畢。”\n“收到。”\n“克拉斯礦區已清洗完畢。”\n“收到。”\n“奧涅加礦區已清洗完畢。”\n“收到。”\n……\n終端播報聲不絕於耳，像是一首節奏單一且無限循環的樂曲。\n夜空中極光飄搖，這道美麗的帷幕隔絕了凍原上的所有哭嚎。\n這個黑夜格外漫長。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g2_farnorthgovernment"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我明白的，我從來都明白，我敬愛的陛下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白您的仁慈，可是，從來不會有人因仁慈而被敬重……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個失去了能源命脈的國家能有什麼下場？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"淪為仰人鼻息的牲畜，或是在那之前，奪來足夠讓自己維生的能源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您也應當明白，這不是集團軍的渴求……這是烏薩斯的渴求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯絕不能軟弱，如果她即將變得軟弱，那我們便要剜去讓她軟弱的部分。一旦她表現出軟弱，便會在頃刻間被其他掠食者分食殆盡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"道理如此……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葉莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是多麼困難的沉默啊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"葉莉莎女大公輕輕地將蓋有議會火漆印的信箋投入了溫暖的壁爐。\n一陣輕微的火焰升騰聲響起，一切又歸於平靜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g8_farnorthtundra_aurora"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別喬克……冷靜一點，聽我說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要害怕……不要放棄，我們還有機會能活下來，我們還能帶領大家一起離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想離開……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但，“屠殺”……殺人？他們，在封住……所有人的嘴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前是用，奶油和，咖啡；再後來，是給我們，鞭子，和死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸媽媽，他們，沒有閉嘴，所以他們……死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別喬克……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果，閉嘴，也還是會死呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些礦區，我們聽到的……他們，都死了？但只有，我們，知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我們也被，“閉嘴”，之前，難道不該，讓更多人，知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們，殺不光，所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說得有道理，但我們現在對外發送訊息的話，就是赤裸裸地向離我們近在咫尺的集團軍暴露位置……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們……"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿洛伊澤將後面的話吞了下去，那些出於理性的考量，此刻無論如何也說不出口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別喬克說得沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們絕不能讓這裡發生的一切被悄無聲息地掩埋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra女士，您剛剛才經歷過一場惡戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的職責。不必擔心，阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我怎麼可能不擔憂……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您本來不願再度來到這片位於北方的土地，不願暴露自己的源石技藝。這背後一定有什麼原因，無論是您不願他人知曉的過往，還是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島不會讓任何幹員承受原本不必承受的代價。我不知道您曾經在這裡經歷過什麼，但我知道，克服過往需要極大的勇氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你的理解，阿米婭。但現在……我不再需要對過往諱莫如深，因為我已經將那些拋在身後了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我們將公開發生在這裡的慘劇，向所有人拆穿他們的陰謀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好……好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，當事人就在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們開始吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i13"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"設備調整完畢……隊長，狀態如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"狀態正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我們繼續擴大範圍了。Raidian小姐呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"稍等。也許我能藉助頻繁的磁暴現象，反過來利用那些雜訊裡攜帶的電訊號……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra，現在感覺怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我聽到更多。"},{"type":"narration","text":"“更多”，一個含糊的描述。實際上她不僅聽到更多，還聽得更遠、更細——\n她聽見高速戰艦的履帶碾過凍原，還有源石引擎與炮鳴都無法遮蔽的哭嚎。\n她也聽見說著烏薩斯南部方言的父母在孩子們的額頭逐個印下晚安吻，聽見情侶的呢喃愛語，從窗前親吻到沙發，想過拉上窗簾但最終遺忘。\n她還聽見北原某個城際電台的聲音在磁暴影響下斷斷續續，聽見養老院裡一位老人撫摸懷中的雲獸，逐漸陷入睡夢……\n她幾乎以為自己能夠聽見一切，而後，也能將聽見的所有都打斷，放入必須的話語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“礦區——”"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mantra突然意識到這句話不應該由自己說出來。\n至少不應該只由自己說出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別喬克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是你提出的，也是你想傳達的話語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，和我一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是我、我說不，清楚——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你做得到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“礦區與城市的同伴們。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“礦區與城市的，同伴們。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“我們來自遠北。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“我們來自……遠北。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“我們正在被屠殺。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“我們正在被……”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“屠殺。”\n礦區與城市的同伴們，我們是被追緝的礦工，我們來自遠北。\n我們還活著，但我們正在被屠殺。\n不是我們背棄了烏薩斯，而是烏薩斯……\n拋棄了我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g8_farnorthtundra_aurora"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——我做到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你做到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可能需要一點幫助。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
